{
  "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
  "body": "Hi,\r\nthe binary should be self-contained (i.e. it bundles its own python interpreter with all the dependencies). You can try to change the extension of your file from `.heic` to `.hif` and see if that works. If it does, you can add the following `heic.txt` to your imageio dir:\r\n\r\n```text\r\n[ART ImageIO]\r\nLabel=HEIC\r\nExtension=heic\r\nReadCommand=python hif/heif_io.py\r\nFormat=float\r\n```\r\n\r\n(If it does work, I'll update the plugin with the missing extension for future releases)",
